# "Equip legendary creature {3}" needs a legendary creature: with only an Elvish Mystic Bot1 controls, it is not offered on turn 3 (the
# refusal), and "Equip {7}" puts the Arm on the Mystic - a 7/7 (CR 613.4b). "Can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less" is
# a boundary: Bot2's Elvish Mystic (power 1) may not block it (refusal) while its Cogwork Librarian (power 3) may (the positive control)
# and dies to 7 damage; the Mystic takes 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Sol Ring
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Wrecking Ball Arm
Elvish Mystic
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cogwork Librarian
Elvish Mystic
Island x12

